{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18083","headline":"赠别元十八协律六首 一 · 韩愈","name":"赠别元十八协律六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知识久去眼，吾行其既远。\n瞢瞢莫訾省，默默但寝饭。\n子兮何爲者，冠佩立宪宪。\n何氏之从学，兰蕙已满畹。\n於何翫其光，以至岁向晚。\n治惟尚和同，无俟於謇謇。\n或师绝学贤，不以艺自挽。\n子兮独如何，能自媚婉娩。\n金石出声音，宫室发关楗。\n何人识章甫，而知骏蹄踠。\n惜乎吾无居，不得留息偃。\n临当背面时，裁诗示缱绻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}